samaḥ saṅga-vivarjitaḥ\"},{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"verse_text\",\"id\":3592,\"bb\":3164,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/12/18-19/b3164/\",\"body_value\":\"tulya-nindā-stutir maunī
