jñānaṁ jñeyaṁ ca keśava\"},{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"verse_text\",\"id\":3607,\"bb\":3178,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/13/1-2/b3178/\",\"body_value\":\"śrī-bhagavān uvāca
